message.content:
This is a PVC yoga mat, which CBP has addressed in rulings. Yoga mats are generally classified in 3926.90 as other articles of plastics, or in 9506.91 as articles and equipment for general physical exercise.

Several CBP rulings classify yoga mats of PVC in 9506.91.0030, "Articles and equipment for general physical exercise, gymnastics, athletics... Other: Exercise equipment, other." Other rulings have classified plain foam yoga mats in 3918 or 3926. For a mat specifically designed for yoga, 9506.91 is the more common outcome. Some rulings place yoga mats under 9506.91.0030, and I am going with that.

{"hts_code": "9506.91.0030", "reason": "A PVC yoga mat designed for yoga and floor exercise is classified as articles and equipment for general physical exercise under heading 9506, subheading 9506.91, in the 'other' exercise equipment provision."}
